  "mechanism": {
    "prepared": "Fresh admission at readiness can cancel an exact-size one-shot frame before submission. Both sized paths require exact worker and supervisor retirement.",
    "native": "Both cold and prepared Radeon trials decode and verify the exact immutable source, publish through the ordinary mirrored writer, and independently reopen on CPU. The measured cost charges setup and the native transaction. Independent reopen is outside that timing scope.",
    "diagnostics": "Separate elapsed timing stages for a runtime error, hipErrorNotReady after synchronization and a successful return with an invalid duration. Preserve the existing device-fault recovery category and retire without a usable profile."
  },
